board/ui/** -text -whitespace
results/model_planning/h576_closeout_20261016_01/** -text -whitespace
results/model_planning/v5_h576_fair_20261016_02/** -text -whitespace
results/model_planning/v5_h576_quality_20261016_01/** -text -whitespace
results/model_planning/v5_h576_ui_20261017_01/** -text -whitespace
